fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstjpegparser.html#gst_jpeg_segment_parse_frame_header","fragment":"\n\tgst_jpeg_segment_parse_frame_header\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.JpegSegment.prototype.parse_frame_header\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.JpegSegment.parse_frame_header\n\nParses the frame_hdr JPEG frame header structure members from segment.\nThe caller must make sure there is enough data for the whole segment\navailable.\nParameters:\nthe JPEG segment\nThe GstJpegFrameHdr structure to fill in\nTRUE if the frame header was correctly parsed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nParses the frame_hdr JPEG frame header structure members from segment.\nThe caller must make sure there is enough data for the whole segment\navailable.\nParameters:\nthe JPEG segment\nReturns a tuple made of:\nTRUE if the frame header was correctly parsed.\nTRUE if the frame header was correctly parsed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nParses the frame_hdr JPEG frame header structure members from segment.\nThe caller must make sure there is enough data for the whole segment\navailable.\nParameters:\nthe JPEG segment\nReturns a tuple made of:\nTRUE if the frame header was correctly parsed.\nTRUE if the frame header was correctly parsed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\n"});